Optimum license map

Optimum is a composite work. The repository contains original Optimum tools,
upstream-derived source overlays, patch files, and third-party material.

The MIT License in `LICENSE-MIT` applies only to the paths marked MIT in
`LICENSE-SCOPE.md`.

All other paths retain the historical terms in
`LICENSE-OPTIMUM-LEGACY-GPL-COMMONS`, unless an upstream or third-party notice
states different terms. This change does not relicense or waive rights in
upstream-derived material.

See `NOTICE` for the provenance notes recorded during the license audit.
